 Japanese Gardens","notes":"Pair this North Third Street stop with a scheduled production, checking the official season listing before choosing a date.","short_summary":"A community performing-arts venue on the garden corridor.","evidence_claim":"H.A.R.D. locates Douglas Morrisson Theatre at 22311 North Third Street and documents a performance series featuring local, national, and international talent.","source_url":"https://haywardrec.org/355/Theater-Arts","source_title":"Theatre Arts","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Entry depends on the scheduled production; consult the official calendar and ticket listing before visiting.","cost_status":"purchase_required","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"meek-estate-park-hampton-road","subject_type":"street_or_district","entity_name":"Meek Estate Park","title":"Meek Estate Park for Historic Grounds","subtitle":"Hampton Road corridor · Cherryland","notes":"Enter from Hampton Road to see the historic-building setting, lawn, picnic areas, and playground during park hours.","short_summary":"Historic estate grounds combined with everyday park amenities.","evidence_claim":"H.A.R.D. lists Meek Estate Park at 240 Hampton Road and documents a historical building, open lawn, picnic areas, playground, and restrooms.","source_url":"https://haywardrec.org/Facilities/Facility/Details/Meek-Park-69","source_title":"Facilities • Meek Estate Park","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The park is documented as open daily from sunrise to sunset; rentals require separate arrangements.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"hayward-shoreline-interpretive-center-breakwater-avenue","subject_type":"street_or_district","entity_name":"Hayward Shoreline Interpretive Center","title":"Shoreline Center f